# Copy to client/.env for local overrides, or set this in your host's build
# environment (Netlify: Site configuration -> Environment variables).
#
# This is the FULL base URL of the API, including the /api path — it replaces
# the base URL outright rather than being joined to it. Getting this wrong is
# the usual reason a deployed build 404s on every request.
#
#   right:  https://checkwise-api.onrender.com/api
#   wrong:  https://checkwise-api.onrender.com
#
# Left unset, the app calls a relative /api, which only works in development
# where the Vite dev server proxies /api and /uploads to http://localhost:5000.
VITE_API_URL=
